WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.667 --> 00:00:02.753
(keyboard clacking)

00:00:02.753 --> 00:00:05.422
It's clear that something
is changing in Erie Harbor.

00:00:05.422 --> 00:00:07.090
(birds squawking)

00:00:07.090 --> 00:00:09.134
 So why is
The Magic Arrow Chronicle

00:00:09.134 --> 00:00:11.511
the only paper reporting
on this?

00:00:11.511 --> 00:00:15.015
If the adults around here
won't do anything about it,
then I will.

00:00:15.015 --> 00:00:18.185
Oh, my God, Hildy.
Shut up!

00:00:18.185 --> 00:00:22.231
In season two, Hildy definitely
has a lot of clues to follow

00:00:22.231 --> 00:00:25.525
with Richie, but also going off
into an environmental case.

00:00:28.278 --> 00:00:32.115
Could you tell me if you have
anything on a strange event
last night?

00:00:32.115 --> 00:00:33.951
Now, you know
how I feel about you,

00:00:33.951 --> 00:00:37.246
but I can't be
your source anymore.

00:00:37.246 --> 00:00:39.540
I love the dynamic and how it
shifted in season two,

00:00:39.540 --> 00:00:43.001
that we're all working together
to find out what happened.

00:00:43.001 --> 00:00:45.462
Hildy's relationship
with Matt,

00:00:45.462 --> 00:00:48.131
and you get to see them
more as the journalist duo.

00:00:48.131 --> 00:00:50.050
Walk me through your evidence,
all right?

00:00:50.050 --> 00:00:52.594
Not what you're feeling,
not what you think,
but the facts.

00:00:52.594 --> 00:00:55.305
Matt sees a lot of himself
in his daughter,

00:00:55.305 --> 00:00:58.058
so it doesn't take much
for Hildy to ignite a spark

00:00:58.058 --> 00:00:59.643
in his passion for journalism.

00:01:00.602 --> 00:01:02.354
That's his story.

00:01:02.354 --> 00:01:06.233
Izzy, gets to come and work
with me at the law firm.

00:01:06.233 --> 00:01:09.861
She's sort of starting
to have a stronger sense
of the world around her,

00:01:09.861 --> 00:01:11.822
and she's speaking out
alongside her sister.

00:01:11.822 --> 00:01:13.991
Izzy, what do you know
about injustice?

00:01:13.991 --> 00:01:16.076
Yeah, well,
I'll tell you what we know.

00:01:16.076 --> 00:01:18.537
(cheering)

00:01:18.537 --> 00:01:20.747
She gains all her confidence
this season as she finds out

00:01:20.747 --> 00:01:22.207
who she actually wants to be.

00:01:22.207 --> 00:01:23.875
Are you gonna tell her
something?

00:01:23.875 --> 00:01:26.128
No. This is Izzy's thing.

00:01:29.172 --> 00:01:32.134
There's a real love
within the Lisko family,

00:01:32.134 --> 00:01:34.594
and also within
the friendships that we forged

00:01:34.594 --> 00:01:38.098
in these two seasons.

00:01:38.098 --> 00:01:41.393
We've definitely bonded so much.

00:01:41.393 --> 00:01:44.271
This secret that Richie had,
it's not gonna stay buried.

00:01:46.023 --> 00:01:47.149
I have a plan, dot, dot, dot.

00:01:51.778 --> 00:01:54.406
I know that look.
So let's skip the part
where I don't wanna do it

00:01:54.406 --> 00:01:56.867
and go straight to the part
where you convince me to.

